      "content": "i dont even know why i keep showing up here. everything i ever cared about... this whole place, the way people used to be... it's all just rotting away. watching it happen is like watching a slow-motion car crash that never actually ends. it's just more and more decay until there's nothing left. what's even the point of staying to see the very end of it? it's just gonna be nothing.",
