      "content": "I understand that it feels like there's no escape from the decay, but sometimes, finding comfort isn't about the external world. It's about finding peace within yourself, even if it's in the midst of the wreckage. Maybe there's a way to find solace in your own resilience, in the strength you've shown by surviving this long. It's okay to feel lost, but remember, even in the darkest times, there's still a part of you that can find a glimmer of light.",
